	quest.74867C6529E40B06.quest_desc: ["These machines can be used to give more info about power generation."]
	quest.75568E9E0EB676C1.quest_desc: ["A &lDissolution Chamber&r is a crafting station that will make most of Industrial Foregoing's items and blocks."]
	quest.75870FEC3BFC942A.quest_desc: ["A &lChute&r pulls items from above it and drops the item below it. Using an Encased Fan, items can be moved upwards through the Chute."]
